---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: Row and byte reservation boundaries
    accDescr: After tenant and resource authorization, reserve the row budget before the bounded query. Serialize the result and reserve its actual bytes before sending. Either refusal leads to denial and an audit event, with no payload released.
    auth["Authorize<br/>tenant + object"] --> rows{"Reserve<br/>rows?"}
    rows -->|Yes| query["Query + LIMIT<br/>serialize body"]
    query --> bytes{"Reserve<br/>bytes?"}
    bytes -->|Yes| send["Send<br/>body"]
    rows -->|No| deny["Deny + audit<br/>no payload"]
    bytes -->|No| deny
    classDef boundary fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef work fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef denied fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    class auth,send boundary
    class query work
    class rows,bytes decision
    class deny denied
